#: ../../library/aioble.rst:119
msgid "Module-level functions"
msgstr "Funkcije na razini modula"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:123
msgid ""
"Forwards to :meth:`bluetooth.BLE.config`, ensuring the BLE radio is active "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Prosljeđuje na :meth:`bluetooth.BLE.config`\\ , osiguravajući da je BLE "
"radio prvo aktivan."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:126
msgid "*args*"
msgstr "*args*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:127
msgid "Optional single parameter name to query."
msgstr "Opcionalni naziv jednog parametra za ispitivanje."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:129
msgid "*kwargs*"
msgstr "*kwargs*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:130
msgid "Keyword arguments to set configuration values."
msgstr "Imenovani argumenti za postavljanje konfiguracijskih vrijednosti."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:134
msgid ""
"Deactivate the underlying BLE radio and run any registered sub-module "
"shutdown handlers. After calling this, scanners, advertisers, connections "
"and L2CAP channels are all torn down."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivirajte osnovni BLE radio i pokrenite sve registrirane rukovatelje za "
"gašenje pod-modula. Nakon ovog poziva, skeneri, oglašivači, veze i L2CAP "
"kanali svi se ruše."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:140
msgid ""
"Returns a `scan` async context-manager / async-iterator that yields "
"`ScanResult` instances for each unique device discovered (or for each new "
"piece of advertising data from a known device)."
msgstr ""
"Vraća `scan` asinkroni upravitelj konteksta / asinkroni iterator koji vraća "
"instance `ScanResult` za svaki jedinstveni otkriveni uređaj (ili za svaki "
"novi dio podataka oglašavanja od poznatog uređaja)."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:144
msgid "*duration_ms*"
msgstr "*duration_ms*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:145
msgid ""
"How long to scan, in milliseconds. Pass ``0`` to scan indefinitely until the"
" context manager exits."
msgstr ""
"Koliko dugo skenirati, u milisekundama. Proslijedite ``0`` za neograničeno "
"skeniranje dok upravitelj konteksta ne izađe."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:148 ../../library/aioble.rst:166
msgid "*interval_us*"
msgstr "*interval_us*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:149
msgid "Scan interval in microseconds. Defaults to 1,280,000."
msgstr "Interval skeniranja u mikrosekundama. Zadano je 1.280.000."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:151
msgid "*window_us*"
msgstr "*window_us*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:152
msgid ""
"Scan window in microseconds (must be less than or equal to *interval_us*). "
"Defaults to 11,250."
msgstr ""
"Prozor skeniranja u mikrosekundama (mora biti manji ili jednak "
"*interval_us*\\ ). Zadano je 11.250."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:155
msgid "*active*"
msgstr "*active*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:156
msgid ""
"If ``True``, perform an active scan (request scan response data). Defaults "
"to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ``True``\\ , izvodi aktivno skeniranje (zahtijeva podatke odgovora na"
" skeniranje). Zadano je ``False``\\ ."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:161
msgid ""
"Async coroutine that begins advertising and waits for an incoming central "
"connection. Returns a `DeviceConnection` representing the connected central,"
" or raises :class:`asyncio.TimeoutError` on timeout."
msgstr ""
"Asinkrona korutina koja započinje oglašavanje i čeka dolaznu vezu centralnog"
" uređaja. Vraća `DeviceConnection` koji predstavlja povezani centralni "
"uređaj, ili podiže :class:`asyncio.TimeoutError` pri isteku vremena."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:167
msgid "Advertising interval, in microseconds."
msgstr "Interval oglašavanja, u mikrosekundama."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:169
msgid "*adv_data*"
msgstr "*adv_data*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:170
msgid ""
"Raw advertising payload. If unset, *adv_data* is built from the remaining "
"keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
"Sirovi korisni podaci oglašavanja. Ako nije postavljeno, *adv_data* se gradi"
" iz preostalih imenovanih argumenata."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:173
msgid "*resp_data*"
msgstr "*resp_data*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:174
msgid ""
"Raw scan response payload. Auto-populated to overflow from *adv_data* if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Sirovi korisni podaci odgovora na skeniranje. Automatski se popunjava "
"preljevom iz *adv_data* ako je potrebno."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:177
msgid "*connectable*"
msgstr "*connectable*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:178
msgid "If ``True``, this is a connectable advertisement."
msgstr "Ako je ``True``\\ , ovo je oglas na koji se može povezati."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:180
msgid "*limited_disc*"
msgstr "*limited_disc*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:181
msgid "Use the limited-discoverable flag instead of general."
msgstr "Koristi zastavicu ograničene vidljivosti umjesto opće."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:183
msgid "*br_edr*"
msgstr "*br_edr*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:184
msgid "Set the BR/EDR-supported flag."
msgstr "Postavlja zastavicu podrške za BR/EDR."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:186
msgid "*name*"
msgstr "*name*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:187
msgid "Optional complete local name to embed."
msgstr "Opcionalni potpuni lokalni naziv za ugradnju."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:189 ../../library/aioble.rst:210
msgid "*services*"
msgstr "*services*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:190
msgid "Iterable of :class:`bluetooth.UUID` to advertise."
msgstr "Iterabilni objekt od :class:`bluetooth.UUID` za oglašavanje."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:192
msgid "*appearance*"
msgstr "*appearance*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:193
msgid "16-bit appearance value (see Bluetooth assigned numbers)."
msgstr "16-bitna vrijednost izgleda (vidi Bluetooth dodijeljene brojeve)."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:195
msgid "*manufacturer*"
msgstr "*manufacturer*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:196
msgid ""
"Tuple of ``(company_id, data_bytes)`` to advertise as manufacturer specific "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Torka ``(company_id, data_bytes)`` za oglašavanje kao podaci specifični za "
"proizvođača."

